# What The Ground Keeps - world layout (edit by hand or with the in-game editor, F10)
# prefab  x  y  z  yaw  [pitch roll]  [key=value ...]   (metres, degrees; y is above terrain unless abs=1)
#
# Route 9 runs north (+z) / south (-z) along x = 0 near the station.

# ---- worn footpaths ---------------------------------------------------------
